{"data": [{"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-01T01:39:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116706577352724770"], "id": "2116706577352724770", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15058, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Not the most beautiful game of football", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116706577352724770"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-11-01T01:33:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116705104061493538"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/whyyoutouzhele…", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2116394739255656680", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/jHQVTlsWLC"}]}, "id": "2116705104061493538", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 4931, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116394739255656680", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "“TBS Claims Japanese Drama is Purely Fictional, CCTV Denounces It as \"Evasion,\" Demands \"Repentance\" and Suspension for Apology\n\nOn October 29, CCTV published an article stating that the second season of the Japanese drama *VIVANT* is a \"political tool cloaked in artistic garb,\" https://t.co/jHQVTlsWLC", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2116705104061493538"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-01T01:00:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116696757262299614"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 7, "start": 0, "tag": "HookEm"}]}, "id": "2116696757262299614", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12937, "like_count": 37, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#HookEm", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116696757262299614"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-11-01T00:32:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116689879153185016"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/whyyoutouzhele…", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2116689175227629790", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/jHocQBRo28"}]}, "id": "2116689879153185016", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 5636, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 8}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116689175227629790", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "“On October 30, the People's Daily Overseas Edition's \"Xiake Island\" published an article commenting on the Mbappé controversy, stating that an apology is merely the first step in rebuilding trust, and demanding that the player and club bear the consequences of their ill-chosen https://t.co/jHocQBRo28", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2116689879153185016"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-31T23:23:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116672343338860630"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 27, "start": 18, "tag": "Hoosiers"}]}, "id": "2116672343338860630", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 26717, "like_count": 134, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "What a win by the #Hoosiers!", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2116672343338860630"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T23:13:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116669868909219936"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/johnloeber/sta…", "end": 135, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/johnloeber/status/2116658820508459376", "start": 112, "url": "https://t.co/aybHR0ZsDc"}]}, "id": "2116669868909219936", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 183, "impression_count": 113192, "like_count": 834, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 31, "retweet_count": 21}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116658820508459376", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Strongly agree with the conclusion here. Been saying it for years. People just want to be respected as posters. https://t.co/aybHR0ZsDc", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116669868909219936"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T22:23:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116657364929515545"], "id": "2116657364929515545", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 162, "impression_count": 256298, "like_count": 670, "quote_count": 9, "reply_count": 121, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "How would people characterize the prestige of a college like Vassar these days and how it’s changed in the last 25+ years? I feel like it had some specific cultural cache when I was younger, and I have no sense of whether it’s persisted. Also curious about Middlebury.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116657364929515545"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-31T22:00:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116651607538487724"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/JcdYvjPxc6", "end": 105, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2116651607538487724/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116651604413714433", "start": 82, "url": "https://t.co/JcdYvjPxc6"}]}, "id": "2116651607538487724", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2548, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tashi is a good dog cousin, helps watch moms dog when she is back in the hospital https://t.co/JcdYvjPxc6", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2116651607538487724"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:57:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116650914367074641"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/M0v2izPh3L", "end": 49, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116650914367074641/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116650905537765376", "start": 26, "url": "https://t.co/M0v2izPh3L"}, {"display_url": "x.com/thestalwart/st…", "end": 73, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/thestalwart/status/2116563600298873317", "start": 50, "url": "https://t.co/9MCD3noqDm"}]}, "id": "2116650914367074641", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 16812, "like_count": 65, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116563600298873317", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This stuff is really good https://t.co/M0v2izPh3L https://t.co/9MCD3noqDm", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116650914367074641"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:45:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116647823596785854"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/thought_less_/…", "end": 247, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/thought_less_/status/2116644525582279016", "start": 224, "url": "https://t.co/NfKZUZYmXJ"}]}, "id": "2116647823596785854", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 35991, "like_count": 65, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116644525582279016", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I haven’t confirmed this myself. So take this with a grain of salt. But what I’ve been told is that the bars are zinc-coated galvanized steel which (if true) means there as never any reason to paint them in the first place. https://t.co/NfKZUZYmXJ", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116647823596785854"}, {"author_id": "30034124", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:41:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116646647304245583"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 20, "start": 6, "tag": "DarkMatterDay"}], "urls": [{"description": "Happy #DarkMatterDay! There's more to the cosmos than meets the eye...", "display_url": "youtu.be/DvgfjMuPs00", "end": 251, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/DvgfjMuPs00", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116543906620084224/62RGfwt9?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116543906620084224/62RGfwt9?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 228, "status": 200, "title": "Muon g-2 | Whispers from dark matter", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DvgfjMuPs00&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/qH3tU21s18"}]}, "id": "2116646647304245583", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 4276, "like_count": 49, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Happy #DarkMatterDay! There's more to the cosmos than meets the eye.\n\nThe precision of the Muon g-2 experiment at Fermilab makes it possible to listen for extremely faint signals from interactions between dark matter and muons.\nhttps://t.co/qH3tU21s18", "url": "https://x.com/Fermilab/status/2116646647304245583"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:20:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116641560343540079"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/fcfyplusg/stat…", "end": 140, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/fcfyplusg/status/2116543354624262560", "start": 117, "url": "https://t.co/DYup1gETyt"}]}, "id": "2116641560343540079", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 70, "impression_count": 27653, "like_count": 865, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 23, "retweet_count": 48}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116543354624262560", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "LLMs are SO POWERFUL they traveled back in time to boost productive growth a few years before ChatGPT even launched: https://t.co/DYup1gETyt", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116641560343540079"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:54:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116619844241981652"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Beijing’s evolving industrial playbook is taking shape in Morocco.", "display_url": "foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/27/chi…", "end": 146, "expanded_url": "https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/27/china-europe-morocco-electric-vehicle-manufacturing-industrial-policy/", "images": [{"height": 1000, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115171728624078848/g0hs2smF?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1500}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115171728624078848/g0hs2smF?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 123, "status": 200, "title": "China Is Building Its Way Around Europe’s EV Tariffs", "unwound_url": "https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/27/china-europe-morocco-electric-vehicle-manufacturing-industrial-policy/", "url": "https://t.co/bcxmssTG6I"}]}, "id": "2116619844241981652", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1864, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "\"China Is Building Its Way Around Europe’s EV Tariffs...Beijing’s evolving industrial playbook is taking shape in Morocco\"\nhttps://t.co/bcxmssTG6I", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2116619844241981652"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:42:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116616830911496603"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 163, "start": 157, "tag": "China"}], "urls": [{"description": "KoBold Metals has asked the US state department for help as it waits on UN Security Council clearance to run aerial surveys", "display_url": "ft.com/content/d35c06…", "end": 261, "expanded_url": "https://www.ft.com/content/d35c065f-0aef-44fa-a0d8-be1e0e5281c8", "images": [{"height": 394, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116114787054522368/wvpG2O1T?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 700}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116114787054522368/wvpG2O1T?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 238, "status": 200, "title": "Gates-backed miner says China is frustrating DR Congo exploration efforts", "unwound_url": "https://www.ft.com/content/d35c065f-0aef-44fa-a0d8-be1e0e5281c8", "url": "https://t.co/CSuBS4I53R"}]}, "id": "2116616830911496603", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1770, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "\"A mining company backed by Bill Gates has asked the US govt for help w/its $50M lithium exploration programme in the Democratic Republic of Congo, alleging #China had resorted to a UN arms embargo to block its use of mapping technology\"\nhttps://t.co/CSuBS4I53R", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2116616830911496603"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:40:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116616401129701716"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "China said Swiss companies are planning to increase investment in the country in sectors including pharmaceuticals and machinery manufacturing.", "display_url": "bloomberg.com/news/articles/…", "end": 88, "expanded_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-31/swiss-firms-plan-investment-boost-in-china-drug-finance-sectors", "images": [{"height": 799, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116430560767688704/nom7n3pN?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116430560767688704/nom7n3pN?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 65, "status": 200, "title": "Swiss Firms Plan Investment Boost in China Drug, Finance Sectors", "unwound_url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-31/swiss-firms-plan-investment-boost-in-china-drug-finance-sectors", "url": "https://t.co/jg2f6uN19B"}]}, "id": "2116616401129701716", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1760, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Swiss Firms Plan Investment Boost in China Drug, Finance Sectors\nhttps://t.co/jg2f6uN19B", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2116616401129701716"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-31T18:41:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116601398276088151"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/theathleticfc/…", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/theathleticfc/status/2116562531187593232", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/jf6rkzpBQL"}]}, "id": "2116601398276088151", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 7094, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116562531187593232", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "““This situation with China highlights the dangers of today’s world, where often the best thing to do is to keep your mouth shut because there’s a risk in so many of the things you say and comment on, but I’ve seen him act very responsibly and with a very big, classy club,” https://t.co/jf6rkzpBQL", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2116601398276088151"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:59:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116590787861574041"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/discussingfilm…", "end": 67, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/discussingfilm/status/2116214510528983327", "start": 44, "url": "https://t.co/XOebkfIRdT"}]}, "id": "2116590787861574041", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2868, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116214510528983327", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This sounds much better than the 2013 movie https://t.co/XOebkfIRdT", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116590787861574041"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T17:54:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116589576269746425"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 36, "start": 24, "tag": "SaveTheBars"}], "mentions": [{"end": 79, "id": "239026022", "start": 73, "username": "SamRo"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/UFb9RL0tzT", "end": 111, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116589576269746425/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116589565288816640", "start": 88, "url": "https://t.co/UFb9RL0tzT"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/UFb9RL0tzT", "end": 111, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116589576269746425/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116589565297274880", "start": 88, "url": "https://t.co/UFb9RL0tzT"}]}, "id": "2116589576269746425", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 37950, "like_count": 224, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "It’s a beautiful day to #SaveTheBars at Tompkins Square. Even our friend @samro is here https://t.co/UFb9RL0tzT", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116589576269746425"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T16:18:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116565498532098436"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/regimeideologu…", "end": 169, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/regimeideologue/status/2116564791670296706", "start": 146, "url": "https://t.co/aEjSYehCFW"}]}, "id": "2116565498532098436", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 18, "impression_count": 42108, "like_count": 708, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 31, "retweet_count": 20}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116564791670296706", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "He’s actually not. Like it’s 2026 and your economy is built around hacking crypto and using your citizens as mercenaries? It’s kinda cringe, imo. https://t.co/aEjSYehCFW", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116565498532098436"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T16:11:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116563600298873317"], "id": "2116563600298873317", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 55102, "like_count": 476, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 42, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "It’s been a fun experiment. But this diet of just eating meat and kimchi may be running its course for me. I think as of today, I’m swapping in sauerkraut for a little while.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116563600298873317"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:24:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116551796340490366"], "id": "2116551796340490366", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 18510, "like_count": 154, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "In many respects, when I look at the world these days, I divide it between 'China' and 'Everywhere else'.\n\nThe exception is anything having to do with social media and phones, which seem to have the same effects on society anywhere in the world.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116551796340490366"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:21:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116551152699404792"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/realsert8964/s…", "end": 82, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/realsert8964/status/2116550475860558178", "start": 59, "url": "https://t.co/COTunXYX05"}]}, "id": "2116551152699404792", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 81, "impression_count": 32399, "like_count": 289, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 41}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116550475860558178", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Next installment of this genius mocking of the mbappe mess https://t.co/COTunXYX05", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2116551152699404792"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-31T15:12:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116548930653835661"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/mtkonczal/stat…", "end": 269, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/mtkonczal/status/2116521192631017555", "start": 246, "url": "https://t.co/jlx81ToImK"}]}, "id": "2116548930653835661", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2703, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116521192631017555", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I enjoyed reading Mike’s piece.\n\nImho regardless of your political orientation, the next few years (at least) of policymaking will involve making unpleasant tradeoffs and tightening belts\n\nThe “slack resources” context of the late 2010s is gone. https://t.co/jlx81ToImK", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2116548930653835661"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:34:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116539207833317603"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 108, "start": 94, "tag": "Manufacturing"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Sino_Market/st…", "end": 286, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Sino_Market/status/2116348489047380122", "start": 263, "url": "https://t.co/CFspT1ghkH"}]}, "id": "2116539207833317603", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1969, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116348489047380122", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "What's amusing here is not the directional 🇨🇳 PMI result (weakness), which we also saw in our #Manufacturing data for October.\n\nIt's that expectations for the month were...a perfect 50.0.\n\nHow do more folks not break out in laughter when dealing w/this nonsense? https://t.co/CFspT1ghkH", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2116539207833317603"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-31T14:32:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116538931663540255"], "id": "2116538931663540255", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 167, "impression_count": 176257, "like_count": 1491, "quote_count": 19, "reply_count": 138, "retweet_count": 47}, "text": "It’s funny, I think I’m pretty AI-pilled. And I’m sure a lot of people who follow me think I’m AI-pilled to an annoying degree.\n\nBut I can easily go days without really using it. And there is no job I encounter professionally where I think AI is anywhere close to human level.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2116538931663540255"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "14096763", "name": "Joe Weisenthal", "username": "TheStalwart"}, {"id": "3512101", "name": "Bill Bishop", "username": "niubi"}, {"id": "2961589380", "name": "Liz Ann Sonders", "username": "LizAnnSonders"}, {"id": "30034124", "name": "Fermilab", "username": "Fermilab"}, {"id": "702235316812275712", "name": "Guy Berger", "username": "EconBerger"}, {"id": "497231011", "name": "China Beige Book", "username": "ChinaBeigeBook"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2116706577352724770", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzly3a4d1rxxtfejvv4i3ql6kferh", "oldest_id": "2116538931663540255", "result_count": 25}}
